  "rationale": "One predicate changed and nothing else. gatherFrontier bucketed a research target into the research-node or rediscover-node candidate list on the raw ever-known mark, which is never cleared, so every node the universe currently held was filed as a lost art; it now asks rules-magic isRediscovery -- wasEverKnown AND NOT exists -- the same predicate the research quote and the research charge already use. No constant, cap, magnitude or content value moved. The gated metrics move because goal selection moved, and the direction is the mechanism working rather than a magnitude being tuned: acquisition is no longer front-loaded into a land grab over nodes nobody had lost, so the five-year and twenty-year totals fall while referenceNodesGainedFinalQuarter rises 1.875 to 7.595 (64.55 SE) and the two-hundred-year end state is unchanged inside tolerance on every metric. Regenerated rather than tolerance-widened, and all three files are re-recorded together so the chain stays coherent, the ascension sweep included even though it passed.",
